读线程卡在 poll() 等数据时，只有数据到了或者 POLLING_TIME 一片等完才会
看到中断回调。这片原来是 100ms。直播转发源（udpxy、rtp2httpd 一类）
常按几十毫秒一批往下发，换台 stop 时播放器要等下一批数据到了，读线程
才退出。Pixel 上 FSPlayer 的 stop 里 join 读线程要 1~35ms，全算在下一台
的等待里。

改成 5ms。没数据的一片结束后只是重新 poll；各处超时都按片数折算
（runs = timeout / POLLING_TIME），总时长不变。代价是空等时每秒多醒
约 200 次，每次只是一次 poll 和一次中断回调。

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 libavformat/network.h | 9 ++++++++-
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/libavformat/network.h b/libavformat/network.h
index 7c72c90..d7bb41c 100644
--- a/libavformat/network.h
+++ b/libavformat/network.h
@@ -246,7 +246,14 @@ const char *ff_gai_strerror(int ecode);
 
 int ff_is_multicast_address(struct sockaddr *addr);
 
-#define POLLING_TIME 100 /// Time in milliseconds between interrupt check
+/*
+ * Time in milliseconds between interrupt checks while waiting on a socket.
+ * A reader blocked in poll() only sees an abort request when data arrives or
+ * this slice ends; live TV relays often send in bursts tens of ms apart, so
+ * 100 ms made every channel change wait for the next burst. Slices that end
+ * without data just poll again; timeouts count slices, so they are unchanged.
+ */
+#define POLLING_TIME 5
 
 /**
  * Bind to a file descriptor and poll for a connection.
